WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.804
My name is Mike.

2
00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:08.667
I play hockey.

3
00:00:08.668 --> 00:00:11.171
But I don't play ice hockey.

4
00:00:11.172 --> 00:00:14.727
I play a sport called sled hockey.

5
00:00:14.728 --> 00:00:17.599
Do you know what sled hockey is?

6
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.701
Let's go to the ice rink.

7
00:00:20.702 --> 00:00:24.493
I'll tell you more about this cool sport!

8
00:00:24.494 --> 00:00:28.540
Sled hockey is for people with disabilities.

9
00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:32.605
It started in Sweden in the 1960s.

10
00:00:32.606 --> 00:00:35.602
Some men in wheelchairs invented it.

11
00:00:35.603 --> 00:00:38.362
They missed playing ice hockey.

12
00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:41.283
So they invented a new way to play.

13
00:00:41.284 --> 00:00:45.117
In sled hockey, a player sits on a special sled.

14
00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:48.207
The sled has two metal blades.

15
00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:51.217
It works just like a big ice skate!

16
00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:54.882
Sled hockey is a little different from ice hockey.

17
00:00:54.883 --> 00:00:57.831
Ice hockey players use one stick.

18
00:00:57.832 --> 00:01:01.485
But sled hockey players use two sticks.

19
00:01:01.486 --> 00:01:04.763
They are shorter than ice hockey sticks.

20
00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.439
Each stick has a pick at one end.

21
00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.833
These picks help players move across the ice.

22
00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:13.868
The other end has a wooden blade.

23
00:01:13.869 --> 00:01:16.567
The blade is for shooting the puck.

24
00:01:16.568 --> 00:01:20.627
Otherwise, sled hockey is just like ice hockey.

25
00:01:20.628 --> 00:01:24.814
Each team has five players and a goalie.

26
00:01:24.815 --> 00:01:30.562
Players wear face masks, helmets, gloves, and pads.

27
00:01:30.563 --> 00:01:34.468
They shoot the puck into the net to score.

28
00:01:34.469 --> 00:01:38.474
Today people play sled hockey all over the world.

29
00:01:38.475 --> 00:01:44.143
It's a very fast and fun game.

30
00:01:44.144 --> 00:01:48.424
I'm ready to get on the ice. Watch this!

31
00:01:48.425 --> 00:01:56.073
I skate . . . I shoot . . . I score!

